          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How many ways can the letters of the word LAGRANGE be arranged so that the two A’s are together and the two G’s are together?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-q5-mary",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mary proposes: treat AA and GG as one element each, so arrange the six elements AA, GG, L, R, N and E.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-q5-mary-count",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Therefore, there are ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "6!",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " ways.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-q5-bob",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "However, Bob disagrees and says that Mary’s answer needs to further divide by ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "2!2!",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " because two A’s and two G’s are identical.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-q5-response",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Who is correct, and why?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
